OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and bright to start with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunny spells through the
OL,7,Fmorning. Showers developing widely
OL,8,Ffrom midday, heavy in places with a
OL,9,Frisk of thunder. Temperatures around
OL,10,Fnormal. Breezy inland, rather windy
OL,11,Falong southern coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers mostly easing off,
OL,14,Fbut may persist for southern coasts
OL,15,Fovernight. Variable cloud and mostly
OL,16,Flight winds, although remaining breezy
OL,17,Ffor southern coasts. Mild, warm in
OL,18,Fplaces.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,171,160,301,260,100,100
